TEXT -800 -1056 Left 3 ;#5 ESR meter from Alan's 2006 drawing
TEXT -800 -992 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bmYAgat-sOQ
TEXT -800 -944 Left 2 ;A 4049 oscillator drives the capacitor under test through a 10 ohm source. The voltage its series resistance leaves behind is amplified, rectified and read on a 200 uA meter.
TEXT -800 -816 Left 2 ;CD4049UB oscillator and four output drivers
TEXT 1104 -816 Left 2 ;BNC to DUT; 100u test capacitor is a simulation fixture
TEXT -96 32 Left 2 ;Q1 common-emitter amplifier
TEXT 944 32 Left 2 ;AD8032 first section: diode-feedback DC restore
TEXT 1696 32 Left 2 ;AD8032 second section: buffer and meter drive
TEXT 2720 608 Left 2 ;200uA FSD; coil resistance not given in drawing
TEXT -800 736 Left 2 ;9 V battery / switch / 7805 regulator
TEXT -592 1096 Left 2 ;SW1 shown closed (1 milliohm for simulation)
TEXT 352 896 Left 2 !.param ESR=1 CAL=10k R_METER_COIL=1k
TEXT 352 944 Left 2 !.step param ESR list 0.1 1 10
TEXT 352 992 Left 2 !.tran 0 10m 8m 1u uic
TEXT 352 1040 Left 2 !.meas tran DUT_PP PP V(DUT_LO) FROM 9m TO 10m
TEXT 352 1136 Left 2 !.meas tran OSC_PERIOD TRIG V(osc)=2.5 RISE=5 TARG V(osc)=2.5 RISE=15
TEXT 352 1184 Left 2 !.meas tran OSC_FREQ PARAM 10/OSC_PERIOD
TEXT 352 1088 Left 2 !.meas tran METER_AVG AVG I(RmeterMovement) FROM 9m TO 10m
TEXT 352 1232 Left 2 !.lib ..\..\LTspice\Models\Texas-Instruments\CD4049UB_TI.lib
TEXT 352 1280 Left 2 !.lib ..\..\LTspice\Models\Unverified\LM7805_generic.lib
TEXT 352 1360 Left 2 ;ESR and capacitor value are test fixture choices; coil R and rheostat setting are assumptions.
